/T (induced power requirements.  The number of blades remains unchanged \(Nb = 2\), which is consistent with standard  quadrotor configurations.  The optimized design suggests a 3-cell battery configuration \(vs 4-cell in baseline\),  reducing overall battery weight. )
/E (induced power requirements.  The number of blades remains unchanged \(Nb = 2\), which is consistent with standard  quadrotor configurations.  The optimized design suggests a 3-cell battery configuration \(vs 4-cell in baseline\),  reducing overall battery weight. )
