298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 82 0 R
/T (The reduction in battery requirement directly contributes to a lower airframe weight, as airframe mass scales with battery mass.  The optimized configuration trades slightly higher disk loading for overall reduction  in system weight, resulting in a more efficient design for the given mission.  Overall, the sensitivity-based optimization demonstrates that careful tuning of rotor  pitch, aspect ratio, and battery configuration can significantly improve quadrotor  performance and reduce GTOW. )
/E (The reduction in battery requirement directly contributes to a lower airframe weight, as airframe mass scales with battery mass.  The optimized configuration trades slightly higher disk loading for overall reduction  in system weight, resulting in a more efficient design for the given mission.  Overall, the sensitivity-based optimization demonstrates that careful tuning of rotor  pitch, aspect ratio, and battery configuration can significantly improve quadrotor  performance and reduce GTOW. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
